{"articleNo":"2314","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2314&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"◀2009-2학기 대학원 수료자 등록 추가 신청 및 납부안내▶","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.08.25","hit":"15029","attachments":[{"name":"수료자등록신청서1.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2314&attachNo=2040"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"HStyle0\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"510\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"65\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: 필기,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: 필기,한컴돋움\">2009학년도 2학기부터 대학원에서는 학교에 직접 방문할 필요 없이 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 필기,한컴돋움\"><a href=\"http://202.31.128.77:8080/default.html\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#3366cc\">원스톱서비스</font></a></span><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: 필기,한컴돋움\">에서&nbsp;<br>수료자등록 신청 및 고지서 출력이 되도록</span><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: 필기,한컴돋움\">『수료자등록편의시스템』을 운영하게 되었습니다.</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<font size=\"2\"> 대학원 </font></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"2\">수료(예정)자 중&nbsp; 2010년 2월</font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"2\"> 학위를 받기위한 학위청구나 논문연구를 계속할 학생은 아래와 같이 수료자 등록을 신청하시기 바랍니다. </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"2\">1. 수료자등록 대상</font></span><font size=\"2\"><span>&nbsp;:&nbsp;일반대학원, 산업대학원, 교육대학원 수료생 또는 수료예정자<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;(본교 대학원 수료생은 누구나 신청) 수료 후 논문제출&nbsp;시한 규정 폐지</span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">2. 수료자 등록구분&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. </span></font><span><font size=\"2\">일 반&nbsp; 등 록 :&nbsp; 논문연구를 계속하고자 하는 자&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. </font></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font color=\"#808080\"><font size=\"2\">논문연구등록 :&nbsp; 논문연구학점 미 취득자(논문연구 불합격자)<br><br><!--StartFragment--></font>\n</font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#808080\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"2\">3. 수료자 등록 추가 신청</font></span></font></p><font color=\"#808080\">\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 추가 신청기간 : <u><font color=\"#0000ff\">2009. 8. 26.(수) ~&nbsp; 8. 27.(목) [2일간]</font></u></font></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 신청장소 : <font color=\"#ff00ff\">대학원 지원팀 (글로벌관 412호)으로 방문하여 신청.</font></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 신청시 제출서류</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 수료자 등록 신청서 1부.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 수료증명서 1부.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"2\"><br></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"2\">4. 수료자 등록생 등록금 납부 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가.</span><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">일반등록 : 등록금액의 5%, 논문연구등록: 등록금액의 10%</span></font></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 추가 납부기간 : </font></span><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"2\"><u>2009. 9. 2(수) ~ 9. 4(금) [3일간]</u>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; <font color=\"#000000\">다. 대상자 : 수료자 등록 추가 신청자 및&nbsp;원스톱서비스 이용 신청자 중 미 납부자.</font></font></span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 고지서 출력방법 : 원스톱서비스/로그인/수료자관리/고지서출력</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></font></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 등록금 납부장소 : 농협 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font face=\"Verdana\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 등록금 납부금액 : 수료자별 해당되는 등록금액 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp; ※&nbsp;<!--StartFragment--> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">수료자등록금 납부가 완료되어야 2009년도 2학기 수료자등록생이 되므로 소정의 기한에 반드시 납부하여야 함</span></font></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"123\" bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\" height=\"31\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">대학원</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"85\" bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\" height=\"31\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">분야별</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"134\" bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\" height=\"31\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">등록구분</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #0000